"This message contains a link that the user will be able to click on to visit "
"the help page. Make sure you correctly keep the information between the "
"angle brackets (<...>). The double quotes (\") should never be changed in "
"tags, even if your language uses a different type of quotation marks."
msgstr ""
"Denne meddelelse indeholder et link som brugeren kan klikke på for at besøge "
"siden med hjælp. Sørg for at beholde informationen mellem vinkelparenteserne "
"(<...>) korrekt. Dobbelt anførselstegn (\") skal aldrig ændres i tags, selv "
"hvis dit sprog bruger en anden type anførselstegn."

#: virtaal/support/tutorial.py
#, fuzzy, python-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This message contains a similar link, but the programmers decided to to "
