msgid ""
"This message contains a similar link, but the programmers decided to rather "
"insert the tags by using variables so that translators can't change them. "
"Make sure you position the two variables (%s) so that they correspond to the "
"opening and closing tags of the previous translation."
msgstr ""
"Denne meddelelse indeholder et tilsvarende link, men programmøerne "
"besluttede i stedet at indsætte tags med variabler så oversætterne ikke kan "
"ændre dem. Sørg for at du placere de to variabler (%s) så de svare til åbne- "
"og lukke-tags af den forrige oversættelse."

